{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260919205306_62dd898d","chunk_index":1,"job_id":"mwjob_c7cb8596c2388b9a6e6247cd","precondition_digest":"c69b53bbb89246779aea991d7912cc842abf1ccdeae7d1d9d01086ba80be949f","project_id":"proj_user_158a4a0fbf64","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v1","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_158a4a0fbf64_7bcaeae14e137cac","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_158a4a0fbf64_291d158c30210e79","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_158a4a0fbf64_55c232002abd2e03","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_158a4a0fbf64_562588a87dfa9e27","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_158a4a0fbf64_c0d9e05fde0a0a00","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_158a4a0fbf64_8a826aff5d6a9da3","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_158a4a0fbf64_0ed5eae4238e38e4","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_158a4a0fbf64_97dbfc21a58e6021"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260919205306_62dd898d","evidence_span_ids":["es_s2_title","es_s2_version","es_s2_drug","es_s2_indication","es_s2_phase","es_s2_region","es_s2_obj_primary","es_s2_obj_secondary","es_s2_design","es_s2_alloc","es_s2_no_adaptive","es_s2_no_sample_reest","es_s2_no_interim","es_s2_no_src","es_s2_no_dmc","es_s2_pop","es_s2_inclusion","es_s2_exclusion","es_s2_intervention","es_s2_dose_active","es_s2_dose_placebo","es_s2_background","es_s2_prohibited","es_s2_washout","es_s2_dose_adjust","es_s2_dose_interrupt","es_s2_period","es_s2_visit_limit","es_s2_visit_strategy","es_s2_ep_primary","es_s2_ep_secondary","es_s2_ep_safety","es_s2_sample","es_s2_stats","es_s2_estimand","es_s3_ae","es_s4_prior_conmed","es_s5_ae_assess","es_s6_records","es_s7_ethics","es_s1_sec1_empty"],"heading":"方案概要","proposal_text":"本方案编号为MW-II-F36943B9-DRAFT，当前版本为草案，研究题目为合成药V用于治疗慢性荨麻疹的II期临床研究。试验药物为合成药V，适应症为慢性荨麻疹，研究分期为II期，开发区域为中国。研究目的包括：主要目的为评估合成药W在CSU受试者中的疗效；次要目的为评估安全性与完全起效受试者比例。总体设计为随机双盲安慰剂对照II期研究，采用平行分组，不计划自适应设计、样本量再估计、期中分析、SRC或DMC。目标研究人群为18-75岁成人CSU患者；入选标准要求符合国际指南CSU诊断标准，风团持续或反复发作超过6周，且筛选期症状活动度评估可及；排除诱导性荨麻疹病因以及妊娠期或哺乳期女性。研究干预为合成药W口服、每日一次、连续12周，对照为安慰剂口服、每日一次、连续12周；背景抗组胺治疗按方案统一给药，研究期间禁止使用全身性免疫抑制剂，既往系统治疗需洗脱至基线稳定。研究期间无计划剂量调整；若存在临床显著不良事件或实验室异常，经研究者判断需暂停时，暂停研究药物给药直至异常恢复或稳定。研究时期包括筛选期第-2至0周及双盲治疗期第0至12周，设置第0、4、8、12周固定访视，并按筛选、基线随机、第4/8/12周访视及安全性随访执行。主要终点为第12周ISS7荨麻疹活动度评分较基线变化；关键次要终点为第12周完全起效受试者比例；安全性终点为TEAE发生率与实验室异常。样本量按II期探索性策略基于可行性与预期效应量确定；统计分析采用主要终点组间比较分析，SAP定稿；疗效变量采用估计目标，伴发事件按治疗策略处理。安全性信息记录方面，自签署知情同意书至首次使用研究药物前发生的任何不良医疗事件作为安全性信息记录；首次使用研究药物后至最后一次访视期间发生的不良事件按AE收集；签署知情同意书至首次给药期间发生的有临床意义的异常不记录为AE，除非经医学判断认为该异常与研究规定的检查操作或流程有关。既往用药定义为筛选期内获得知情同意后且研究药物首次给药前使用的药物，研究药物首次给药后使用的药物记录为合并用药。研究开始前，方案、知情同意书及其他必需材料应提交伦理委员会审阅并批准；研究相关必备文件应保存至研究药物被批准上市后至少5年，或研究完成（CSR定稿）或终止后至少5年，以时间较长者为准。","rationale":"绑定S2中研究题目、分期、开发区域、目的、设计、人群、干预、终点、访视、估计目标与统计策略等已确认事实；安全性信息与既往/合并用药措辞参考S3/S4/S5；伦理与文件保存措辞参考S6/S7；S1显示该章节当前为空。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_158a4a0fbf64_7bcaeae14e137cac","section_number":"1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:7ebc2587a11786f3998cea16","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_201a73f0db7a426fef5e:r10:7120234c7652b31c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:1e80f33ff07300"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260919205306_62dd898d","evidence_span_ids":["es_s1_sec2","es_s2_title","es_s2_indication","es_s2_phase","es_s2_region","es_s2_obj_primary","es_s2_obj_secondary","es_s2_obj_internal","es_s2_design","es_s2_pop","es_s2_inclusion","es_s2_intervention","es_s2_dose_active","es_s2_dose_placebo","es_s2_period","es_s2_visit_limit","es_s2_visit_strategy","es_s2_ep_primary","es_s2_ep_secondary","es_s2_ep_safety"],"heading":"研究背景和立项依据","proposal_text":"慢性荨麻疹是本研究拟解决的适应症，研究人群为18-75岁成人慢性自发性荨麻疹（CSU）患者。CSU以风团持续或反复发作为主要表现，本方案入选标准要求符合国际指南CSU诊断标准，风团持续或反复发作超过6周，并且筛选期症状活动度评估可及。试验药物为合成药V，研究分期为II期，开发区域为中国。本研究的立项目的是评估合成药W在CSU受试者中的疗效与安全性；为此采用随机双盲安慰剂对照II期设计，平行分组，对照为安慰剂口服每日一次连续12周，研究干预为合成药W口服每日一次连续12周。研究设置筛选期第-2至0周与双盲治疗期第0至12周，并在第0、4、8、12周进行固定访视。主要终点采用第12周ISS7荨麻疹活动度评分较基线变化，关键次要终点为第12周完全起效受试者比例，安全性终点为TEAE发生率与实验室异常。上述设计要素共同构成本研究立项依据的核心内容。","rationale":"绑定S1中该章节既有条目与S2中研究题目、适应症、人群、目的、设计、干预、终点、时期与访视等已确认事实。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_158a4a0fbf64_291d158c30210e79","section_number":"2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:7ebc2587a11786f3998cea16","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_201a73f0db7a426fef5e:r10:7120234c7652b31c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:1e80f33ff07300"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260919205306_62dd898d","evidence_span_ids":["es_s1_sec2_1","es_s2_indication","es_s2_pop","es_s2_pop_overview","es_s2_inclusion","es_s2_exclusion","es_s2_background","es_s2_washout","es_s2_prohibited"],"heading":"疾病背景及治疗现状","proposal_text":"慢性荨麻疹为本研究适应症，目标研究人群为18-75岁成人慢性自发性荨麻疹（CSU）患者。方案入选标准明确要求符合国际指南CSU诊断标准，风团持续或反复发作超过6周，且筛选期症状活动度评估可及；排除标准包括诱导性荨麻疹病因以及妊娠期或哺乳期女性。治疗现状方面，本研究将背景抗组胺治疗作为必需背景治疗并按方案统一给药；既往系统治疗需洗脱至基线稳定；研究期间禁止使用全身性免疫抑制剂作为合并治疗。上述安排反映了在CSU患者中于抗组胺治疗基础上开展研究药物评价的当前治疗与评估背景。","rationale":"绑定S2中适应症、目标人群、入选/排除标准、背景抗组胺治疗、洗脱要求与禁止合并用药等已确认事实，并参考S1该章节原有疾病名称条目。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_158a4a0fbf64_55c232002abd2e03","section_number":"2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:7ebc2587a11786f3998cea16","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_201a73f0db7a426fef5e:r10:7120234c7652b31c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:1e80f33ff07300"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260919205306_62dd898d","evidence_span_ids":["es_s1_sec2_2","es_s2_drug","es_s2_drug_type","es_s2_route","es_s2_form","es_s2_exposure","es_s2_intervention","es_s2_dose_active","es_s2_dose_placebo","es_s2_background","es_s2_prohibited"],"heading":"作用机制及同类药物研究进展","proposal_text":"合成药V为小分子药物（small molecule），给药途径为口服，剂型为片剂，局部/系统暴露范围为systemic。本项目研究干预为合成药W口服、每日一次、连续12周；对照为安慰剂口服、每日一次、连续12周。在CSU治疗背景下，本研究将背景抗组胺治疗作为必需背景治疗并按方案统一给药，研究期间禁止使用全身性免疫抑制剂。合成药V以小分子口服制剂形式开发用于慢性荨麻疹，研究干预采用每日一次连续12周给药方案。","rationale":"绑定S1该章节关于small_molecule与每日一次连续12周的既有条目，以及S2中药物的技术类型、给药途径、剂型、暴露范围、干预方案、背景治疗与禁止用药等已确认事实。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_158a4a0fbf64_562588a87dfa9e27","section_number":"2.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:7ebc2587a11786f3998cea16","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_201a73f0db7a426fef5e:r10:7120234c7652b31c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:1e80f33ff07300"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260919205306_62dd898d","evidence_span_ids":["es_s1_sec2_3","es_s2_drug","es_s2_drug_type","es_s2_route","es_s2_form","es_s2_exposure","es_s2_intervention","es_s2_dose_active","es_s2_dose_placebo","es_s2_dose_adjust","es_s2_dose_interrupt","es_s2_background","es_s2_prohibited","es_s2_washout"],"heading":"研究药物简介","proposal_text":"研究药物为合成药V，药物技术类型为small molecule，给药途径为口服，剂型为片剂，局部/系统暴露范围为systemic。试验干预为合成药W口服、每日一次、连续12周，剂量与给药方案为口服、每日一次、连续12周；安慰剂采用相同给药方案，即口服、每日一次、连续12周。研究期间无计划剂量调整；若存在临床显著不良事件或实验室异常，经研究者判断需暂停时，暂停研究药物给药，直至异常恢复或稳定。背景抗组胺治疗按方案统一给药，研究期间禁止使用全身性免疫抑制剂；既往系统治疗需洗脱至基线稳定。","rationale":"绑定S2中试验药物、药物技术类型、给药途径、剂型、暴露范围、干预方案、剂量调整、背景治疗与合并用药限制等已确认事实，并参考S1该章节原条目。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_158a4a0fbf64_c0d9e05fde0a0a00","section_number":"2.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:7ebc2587a11786f3998cea16","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_201a73f0db7a426fef5e:r10:7120234c7652b31c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:1e80f33ff07300"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260919205306_62dd898d","evidence_span_ids":["es_s1_sec2_3_1","es_s2_drug_type","es_s2_route","es_s2_form","es_s2_exposure","es_s2_pop","es_s2_intervention"],"heading":"非临床研究结果","proposal_text":"合成药V为非临床评价中的小分子药物（small molecule），给药途径为口服，剂型为片剂，局部/系统暴露范围为systemic。上述药物技术类型、给药途径、剂型与暴露特征构成其非临床研究背景信息。基于该小分子口服制剂特征，本研究在18-75岁成人慢性自发性荨麻疹（CSU）患者中开展II期临床评价，研究干预为合成药W口服、每日一次、连续12周。","rationale":"绑定S1显示该章节当前为空以及S2中药物的技术类型、给药途径、剂型、暴露范围、目标人群与干预方案等已确认事实；缺少非临床结果数据，已在uncertainties中记录。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_158a4a0fbf64_8a826aff5d6a9da3","section_number":"2.3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:7ebc2587a11786f3998cea16","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_201a73f0db7a426fef5e:r10:7120234c7652b31c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:1e80f33ff07300"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260919205306_62dd898d","evidence_span_ids":["es_s1_sec2_3_2","es_s2_drug","es_s2_indication","es_s2_phase","es_s2_region","es_s2_design","es_s2_alloc","es_s2_pop","es_s2_intervention","es_s2_dose_active","es_s2_dose_placebo","es_s2_period","es_s2_visit_limit","es_s2_visit_strategy","es_s2_ep_primary","es_s2_ep_secondary","es_s2_ep_safety"],"heading":"既往临床研究结果","proposal_text":"合成药V拟用于慢性荨麻疹治疗，本研究为在中国开展的II期临床研究，采用随机双盲安慰剂对照设计，平行分组。目标研究人群为18-75岁成人CSU患者；研究干预为合成药W口服、每日一次、连续12周，对照为安慰剂口服、每日一次、连续12周，背景抗组胺治疗按方案统一给药。研究设置筛选期第-2至0周与双盲治疗期第0至12周，第0、4、8、12周固定访视，并设安全性随访。主要终点为第12周ISS7荨麻疹活动度评分较基线变化，关键次要终点为第12周完全起效受试者比例，安全性终点为TEAE发生率与实验室异常。本研究将在上述临床开发背景下评估合成药W在CSU受试者中的疗效与安全性。","rationale":"绑定S1显示该章节当前为空以及S2中适应症、分期、开发区域、设计、人群、干预、时期、访视与终点等已确认事实；缺少既往临床研究结果数据，已在uncertainties中记录。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_158a4a0fbf64_0ed5eae4238e38e4","section_number":"2.3.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:7ebc2587a11786f3998cea16","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_201a73f0db7a426fef5e:r10:7120234c7652b31c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:1e80f33ff07300"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260919205306_62dd898d","evidence_span_ids":["es_s1_sec2_4","es_s2_indication","es_s2_pop","es_s2_inclusion","es_s2_design","es_s2_alloc","es_s2_intervention","es_s2_dose_active","es_s2_dose_placebo","es_s2_background","es_s2_prohibited","es_s2_washout","es_s2_ep_primary","es_s2_ep_secondary","es_s2_ep_safety","es_s2_sample","es_s2_stats","es_s2_estimand"],"heading":"本研究的理论基础","proposal_text":"本研究的理论基础建立在以下已确认事实之上：适应症为慢性荨麻疹，目标人群为18-75岁成人CSU患者，入选标准要求符合国际指南CSU诊断标准、风团持续或反复发作超过6周且筛选期症状活动度评估可及。研究采用随机双盲安慰剂对照II期设计，平行分组；研究干预为合成药W口服、每日一次、连续12周，安慰剂口服、每日一次、连续12周；背景抗组胺治疗按方案统一给药，研究期间禁止全身性免疫抑制剂，既往系统治疗洗脱至基线稳定。主要终点为第12周ISS7荨麻疹活动度评分较基线变化，关键次要终点为第12周完全起效受试者比例，安全性终点为TEAE发生率与实验室异常。样本量策略为II期探索样本量基于可行性与预期效应量确定；统计分析策略为主要终点组间比较分析，SAP定稿；疗效变量采用估计目标，伴发事件按治疗策略处理。上述要素共同支持在CSU受试者中评估合成药W疗效与安全性的研究设计。","rationale":"绑定S1该章节原有条目与S2中适应症、人群、入选标准、设计、干预、背景治疗、合并用药限制、终点、样本量、估计目标与统计策略等已确认事实。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_158a4a0fbf64_97dbfc21a58e6021","section_number":"2.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:7ebc2587a11786f3998cea16","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_201a73f0db7a426fef5e:r10:7120234c7652b31c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:1e80f33ff07300"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_158a4a0fbf64_e9341035f09b3ef4:full-draft:7ebc2587a11786f3998cea16","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:7ebc2587a11786f3998cea16","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"8ad8fd72125c34e369a04995cf95ff756b3d98e9589fb360039909eeb615bd3d"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_201a73f0db7a426fef5e:revision:10","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_201a73f0db7a426fef5e:r10:7120234c7652b31c","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"84beb0a2224a912aa0b07f0be309868db56208e58be47ac5f5d0f5e1de059d06"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:29|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"11c21094429a4d9b6fd36d28e6d6b787c134a8c7397ecc704a35c832857515fe"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:26|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"33118fc6958419e645c6a0a19471c78f80e0c4c28be03b46f2b3e61d287e0305"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:25|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"68663fd612a1770f44cc3c20e025cf77d568a22b8c10c9a906d5ceb40702d87e"},{"locator":"section:10.4 记录/文件的保存|block:917|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"a72500684881db79e927821378de3c83348d01ecf1fe4ead4ce68d36e7510735"},{"locator":"section:11.1 遵守法律法规|block:922|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:1e80f33ff07300","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"526307b577de87d936742f3dc805ba1d7885dbae60f521db4422defd399e40f3"}]}